  loreId: lore_l3_note
  title: Bilet lipit pe un raft
  body: "Parola de la nucleu e numele c\xE2inelui directorului. C\xE2inele a murit
    acum trei ani. Parola a r\u0103mas. Dac\u0103 tot cite\u0219ti bilete lipite
    pe rafturi, m\u0103car pune-l la loc."
  titleEn: Note stuck to a rack
  bodyEn: The core password is the director's dog's name. The dog died three years
    ago. The password stayed. If you're going to read notes stuck to racks, at least
    put this one back.
  levelId: level03
  order: 8
